invariant: INV-46
file: mlkem_lanes.h
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh mlkem-vector
reason: the NEON Barrett reduction shifts without adding 2^10 first, so
  its quotient rounds down where mlk_barrett_reduce rounds to the
  nearest, and a coefficient can leave one q away from the scalar
  result. Only an arm64 compiler reads the line, so the script builds
  bin/mlkem_vector_equiv_test for arm64 and runs it under qemu-aarch64.
  The lane skips without docker, and this then reports unguarded rather
  than caught.

--- old
    lanes t = vshrq_n_s16(vaddq_s16(x, vdupq_n_s16(1024)), 11);
--- new
    lanes t = vshrq_n_s16(vaddq_s16(x, vdupq_n_s16(0)), 11);
